# 01 - Strudel solo. One actor, one runtime. Proves Kanopi runs a
# strudel.cc patch with zero regression.
#
# How to play it:
#   1. The actor file `01-drums.strudel` opens automatically. Switch to it
#      with the Files sidebar or the tabs.
#   2. Put the cursor inside the `note(...)` paragraph.
#   3. Press Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter on macOS) to evaluate the block.
#   4. You hear a 4-note sine pattern looping at the default cps.
#   5. Press Ctrl+. to hush.

@actor drums 01-drums.strudel strudel
@scene main drums
